<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 90,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 90,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Friday's actual 90,000 and Saturday's 26,000 head. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts sold mostly steady with mid-session Friday. Top $48.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>			    Country		  Plant</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	     46.00 -47.00	   47.00 -48.00</p>
<p>few			 45.50  47.50	   46.50  48.50</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $2.00. Top $49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.   39.00 -40.00	   39.00 -42.00</p>
<p>	 450-500 lbs.   40.50 -43.00	   41.50 -45.00</p>
<p>	 500 lbs. up    45.00 -47.00	   46.00 -49.00</p>
